        <briefdescription>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para>Remove a value from a <ref refid="classRangeMap" kindref="compound">RangeMap</ref>. This method is invoked by <ref refid="classRangeMap" kindref="compound">RangeMap</ref> when it is removing a value from the map, such as during an erase() or <ref refid="namespaceRose_1_1AST_1_1IO_1ad381296b9da841e9c2aaca003c0972ad" kindref="member">clear()</ref> operation. It is not called for the <ref refid="classRangeMapVoid_1af3d5a8d5c6be2de35c3fbe49e4ef89eb" kindref="member">merge()</ref> argument after a successful merge. </para>        </detaileddescription>
