    <detaileddescription>
<para>Value type for a <ref refid="classRangeMap" kindref="compound">RangeMap</ref> with no useful data attached to the ranges. This also serves as an example documenting the interface for the operations a <ref refid="classRangeMap" kindref="compound">RangeMap</ref> can perform on its values. The single template parameter is the <ref refid="classRange" kindref="compound">Range</ref> type. </para>    </detaileddescription>
